            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Ramen",
            "review_text": "Stephanie S\nDa Nang, Vietnam71 contributions\n0\nMy Favorite Spot in An Thuong\nJan 2020 • Solo\nThis is one of my favorite spots in An Thuong. The salad they bring you prior to the meal is amazing and only eclipsed by the delicious flavor of the ramen. I have eaten my way through half of the menu options and have yet to be anything less than absolutely delighted! Not feeling like ramen? The stir-fry noodles and veggies are fantastic! The staff is great, the price is right and the food is delicious! Two enthusiastic thumbs up!!\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2020",
