            "review_title": "Review at The Vegan Ramen",
            "review_text": "Yoganthahood\nThailand38 contributions\n0\nThe Best Vegan Ramen in Town\nAug 2019\nI came to The Vegan Ramen one day when I was super hungry and it was a great experience. As a vegan, I enjoy trying the local cuisine in each country and this was a gem. First, I had a nice small pasta salad and then the main dish of ramen with seaweed, mushroom and a hearty shitake broth followed. Afterwards, I had a nice dessert of sweet watermelon which was an excellent accompaniment to the meal. If you are in Danang, stop by. The service is very nice and you won't regret it!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 18, 2019",
